		(property "BOM Comments" "Price est. Pins match Garmin 1-4: 1 +5V_SENS (red; VIN 4.75-5.25 V, 85 mA acquiring), 2 GND (black), 3 I2C_SDA (white), 4 I2C_SCL (green). I2C address 0x62; internal 13 kohm pull-ups to 3.3 V, so no external pull-ups or level shifter. Source: branch rangefinder (5b409d0), not merged"
